OL,3,GNEWSAFamily appeal for man missing for
OL,4,Anearly eight years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man who disappeared
OL,7,Fnearly eight years ago say they remain
OL,8,F"desperate for answers".
OL,10,FSteven Durand, from Preston,
OL,11,FLancashire, was reported missing by
OL,12,Fthem on 28 October 2018.
OL,14,FThe 31-year-old was last seen by his
OL,15,Ffamily in Chorley nine days earlier.
OL,16,FPolice believe he travelled by train
OL,17,Ffrom Chorley to Manchester.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
